{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TUNE TO WIN</strong> is a minimalist racing experience about precision, obsession, and control.<br>You don\u2019t unlock new cars or maps: you unlock better versions of yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063020/extras/f7c226f02973b87eae24a7da64d9f589.poster.avif?t=1774603242\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063020/extras/f7c226f02973b87eae24a7da64d9f589.webm?t=1774603242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063020/extras/f7c226f02973b87eae24a7da64d9f589.mp4?t=1774603242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust your car\u2019s settings, run a single lap, and try to finish as fast as possible.<br>Every small change can transform your handling, grip, or speed.<br>Find the perfect balance, set your Personal Best, and climb the global leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run lasts less than a minute, short enough for <i>\u201cjust one more try\u201d</i>,<br>but long enough to get completely hooked.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063020/extras/f4b799d97132898cf483c1c7e03bfb5f.poster.avif?t=1774603242\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063020/extras/f4b799d97132898cf483c1c7e03bfb5f.webm?t=1774603242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063020/extras/f4b799d97132898cf483c1c7e03bfb5f.mp4?t=1774603242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eight adjustable parameters</strong> \u2014 from acceleration to aerodynamics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single focused track</strong> \u2014 built for speed, precision, and mastery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Runs under 1 minutes</strong> \u2014 short, intense, endlessly repeatable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Global leaderboards</strong> \u2014 prove your setup is the fastest in the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimalist visuals</strong> \u2014 black and white art style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic feedback</strong> \u2014 subtle messages that push you to improve, run after run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seasonal tracks</strong> \u2014 new layouts every few months to keep the challenge alive.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>In one line</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s just one lap, but you\u2019ll never stop chasing perfection.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4063020?t=1774603242","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063020/5bfdc45fd2bfb8c8974eabbc59ffac83f5f3bf40/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774603242","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063020/ada5276dcce8d12411e17306ed90be9e62789181/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774603242","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063020/ada5276dcce8d12411e17306ed90be9e62789181/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774603242","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"conte